config BR2_PACKAGE_TINYXML2_V10
	bool "tinyxml2 (10.0.0, for Fast DDS)"
	depends on BR2_INSTALL_LIBSTDCPP
	help
	  TinyXML2 10.0.0. Fast DDS 2.6 does not build against the 11.x API
	  Buildroot ships, so this is the version its packages link against.
	  It installs the same files as the stock tinyxml2 package, so only
	  one of the two may be enabled.

	  https://github.com/leethomason/tinyxml2

comment "tinyxml2 (for Fast DDS) needs a toolchain w/ C++"
	depends on !BR2_INSTALL_LIBSTDCPP
